* Money Market Fund Regulation\n(EU) 2017/1131
** Scope and authorisation
*** UCITS or AIF in short-term assets
*** Money market return or capital preservation
*** Single EU-wide authorisation
*** Protected MMF designation (Art. 6)
** Fund types
*** VNAV (floating NAV, 1 bp)
*** Public debt CNAV (≥ 99.5 % public debt)
*** LVNAV (20 bp collar)
*** Short-term or standard (standard = VNAV only)
** Eligible assets
*** MMIs ≤ 397 days
*** Securitisations and ABCPs
*** Deposits ≤ 12 months
*** Hedging-only derivatives
*** Repos ≤ 7 days, reverse repos
*** Other MMFs ≤ 5 % / 17.5 %
*** No short sales, equity, lending, borrowing
left side
** Diversification and credit
*** 5 % per issuer, 15 % per body
*** 100 % public-debt derogation
*** 10 % concentration cap
*** Internal credit assessment
** Portfolio rules
*** WAM 60 days / 6 months
*** WAL 120 days / 12 months
*** Daily 7.5-10 %, weekly 15-30 %
*** Stress tests, know your customer
** Valuation and liquidity tools
*** Daily mark-to-market
*** Amortised cost ≤ 75 days, 10 bp
*** Fees, gates, suspensions (30 % / 10 %)
*** No external support
** Transparency and reporting
*** Weekly investor information
*** Quarterly report (annual ≤ EUR 100 M)
*** ESMA central database
@endmindmap
